sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Operator
    participant UI as Traceability UI
    participant Client as GraphQL client
    participant HTTP as HTTP app
    participant Exec as GraphQL executor
    participant Repo as Repository
    participant Store as JsonStore
    participant Chain as TraceabilityChain

    Operator->>UI: submit custody event
    UI->>Client: appendTraceEvent(input)
    Client->>HTTP: POST /graphql (mutation)
    HTTP->>HTTP: auth, read-only guard, validate

    HTTP->>Exec: execute mutation
    Exec->>Repo: appendTraceEvent(input)
    Repo->>Store: mutate(draft)
    Store->>Store: structuredClone(state)

    Repo->>Chain: appendEventToRecord(record, input)
    Chain->>Chain: next sequence + timestamp check
    Chain->>Chain: SHA-256(previousHash + canonicalJSON(event))
    Chain-->>Repo: event + updated record

    Repo->>Store: persist(draft) atomic rename
    Store-->>Repo: committed state
    Repo-->>Exec: updated record

    Exec->>Chain: verifyRecordChain(record)
    alt chain valid
        Chain-->>Exec: valid=true, checkedEvents=N
    else chain broken
        Chain-->>Exec: valid=false, brokenAt=eventId
    end

    Exec-->>HTTP: record + chain status
    HTTP-->>Client: JSON result + requestId
    Client-->>UI: data
    UI->>UI: reload detail, focus heading
    UI-->>Operator: toast + verified / exception badge
